999, "height": 681.6}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and differentiation in mESCs via regulating KRAS/ERK sig-", "bbox": {"x": 581.6, "y": 859.3, "width": 32.299999999999955, "height": 672.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "nalling [19]. In addition, miR-142-3p is reported to regulate heart formation in zebrafish [20]. However, it is unknown", "bbox": {"x": 613.9, "y": 859.3, "width": 61.39999999999998, "height": 672.0}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "whether miR-142-3p regulates mammalian cardiogen‹ In this study, we screened miRNAs that might be involved in the differentiation of mESCs into mesoderm", "bbox": {"x": 675.3, "y": 852.7, "width": 93.70000000000005, "height": 681.8999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "and CPCs by miRNA microarray and identified the changes of miR-142-3p abundance during mesodermal and early cardiac differentiation. We then examined the function of miR-", "bbox": {"x": 772.2, "y": 856.0, "width": 90.5, "height": 678.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "142-3p on ESC self-renewal and cardiac differentiation and identified the potential targets. Our data showed that miR-", "bbox": {"x": 863.0, "y": 856.0, "width": 67.5, "height": 678.5}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "142-3p is an important regulator for early cardiac differenti-", "bbox": {"x": 930.6, "y": 856.1, "width": 32.299999999999955, "height": 675.2000000000002}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ation of ESCs. These findings provide insights into the novel role of miR-142-3p in the regulation of cardiac lineage commitment and add information for the further development of cell therapy and drug discovery.", "bbox": {"x": 962.9, "y": 852.9, "width": 129.60000000000002, "height": 681.9}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2. Materials and Methods", "bbox": {"x": 1137.3, "y": 1166.3, "width": 29.09999999999991, "height": 365.10000000000014}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "2.1. Culture and In Vitro Differentiation of ESCs. R1 and E14", "bbox": {"x": 1192.3, "y": 856.1, "width": 29.09999999999991, "height": 675.20000000